{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "289826be3dcd3c5a26645eab60ed479dbaa3a165e58455784765177163375c70", "ja": "（水着ファッションショーの後は、ライブ……。\nさすがに盛り上がったな！）", "zh": "（泳装时尚秀接着就是演唱会……\n全场的气氛果然非常热烈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "cf6616d65e346eabec2288bd228693c9fd30d164bfc78ecd4be037883c1fe5df", "ja": "{$P$}、ここにいたんですね。\nお疲れさまでした♪", "zh": "{$P$}，你在这里呀。\n辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7b535dc73fbea1341f1121126fa01dcb11ad79e458322b8079510ebced4e2dd4", "ja": "お疲れさま、ロコ。", "zh": "辛苦了，ROCO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "85f0701acd49d2a5d093d78e996b4080a299d8d32dcb5fd174f079f40657c6c5", "ja": "{$P$}。{$P$}は\n今日のロコのステージ、どう思いましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，{$P$}觉得\nROCO今天的Stage怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "364e54a93c4074cf6f96f23aac1b1d801b57e04bcef6a3c78dbe299819705624", "ja": "ロコ的には、完璧にロコナイズされたパーフェクトな\nステージングだったと思うんですけど。", "zh": "ROCO认为，这是一场经过完美Roconize、\nPerfect的Staging。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1005_p", "source_sha256": "087ae32a2a2dd9da69f5a0446871491c615891eb5473749bfeb63fc97aa30d6a", "ja": "そうだな。意外性のあるステージが、お客さんも\nいい刺激になって楽しんでたみたいだ。", "zh": "对啊，是场充满惊喜的表演，对观众而言\n也是不错的刺激，大家好像都很享受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "651d5a9bd56f8df7b4602e5a634a074503582f85c22e9ecbcefcc781c89b179d", "ja": "そうなんです！　最近のファッションショーは、\nアートなエッセンスをアダプトする時代……。", "zh": "这就对了！最近的Fashion show，\n是Art的Essence受到Adopt的时代……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "0c22e0bf13efa46f86a45dca4fae9184487fe9d23cc5beffb55bd95725342de9", "ja": "つまり、時代がロコに追いついたんです！\n{$P$}も、そう思いませんか！", "zh": "也就是说，这个时代终于追上ROCO了！\n{$P$}不也这么认为吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1008_p", "source_sha256": "623e7cbe38d843da35891b944cdbfc43b5b96af94b9a0f75aef34b20dbdb4d73", "ja": "う、うん。そう……かも、しれないな……？", "zh": "呃、嗯，或许……是吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "dd7fa24a47e803aa13d8cfc7b38da635d42c9856329554285fe43020697efa6e", "ja": "ファッションショーとライブ、そしてそれを\nステージングするスイムウェアのアイドル……。", "zh": "Fashion show跟Live，\n以及Staging这些的Swimwear偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "c379f0c8e48378d1591a17f0e97519b5d4d97b214cb514c45e78712130a9a656", "ja": "アートとアイドル、2つのファクターが重要な\nロコには、ピッタリなワークでしたよ♪", "zh": "这对重视Art跟偶像这两个要素的ROCO而言，\n是再适合不过的Work喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1011_p", "source_sha256": "54091e0ec4d62fe593e8be68a2398d30dc405adac3e416ee7eb1edff0d4b5afb", "ja": "はは、そうだな。企画会社の人も、またロコと\n仕事したいって言ってたし。次に繋げていこう！", "zh": "哈哈，对啊。负责企划的公司也说\n还想再和ROCO共事，就这样继续接新的工作吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "696d951aa7965fa9de95895d89cb4b4d0d46b687ec73466c817212ff3ac344e4", "ja": "{$P$}！　その時は、\nミーティングからロコにも参加させてくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n到时候要让ROCO从Meeting阶段起就开始参与喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2641f4dedc33910162df6071f39af2b0e31b564c813e8b1778145a70914923bd", "ja": "ああ、考えておくよ。\n……それじゃ、そろそろ帰ろうか。", "zh": "嗯，我会考虑的。\n……那我们也差不多该回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "1a61fa89c6442dfc0260cc1dc0e8221afb4f90172575138360f73e13279f7ba0", "ja": "あ！\n{$P$}、まだ時間はありますか？", "zh": "啊！\n{$P$}，你还有时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "3c4083f29176990bc832e8e6ed96bab37753b08046324cfa1004f1de619d10dd", "ja": "せっかくなので、もう少しだけ\n海をエンジョイしたいって思うんですけど。", "zh": "机会难得，ROCO还想再\nEnjoy一下海边的乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1016_p", "source_sha256": "698f13cb264ac9d9a711e9bc74e20b78848071a947ae30e8691b5a967f3645b5", "ja": "まぁ、少しだけなら……。\nでも陽も落ちたし、泳ぐのはダメだぞ？", "zh": "嗯，不要太久的话……\n但太阳已经下山了，不可以去游泳喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "361bc96a216e8cd21963319a5a47a41fb72e9f9c55c4be81b2629c1d9ffcd8c3", "ja": "オフコースです！\nそれでは、残りの時間は海をながめて……。", "zh": "Of Course！\n那么，剩下的时间就静静地眺望大海……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0063_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "b148d5f4d018797c93c7506bd6fcdf23e89023195b4a5c3122b3801376ad3a8d", "ja": "ロコのインスピレーションを、\nさらにブラッシュアップさせてみせますね♪", "zh": "让ROCO的Inspiration，\n更加Brush up给你看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
